        "created_at": "2016-04-01T04:07:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. End of days took care of the countdown in the first turn. Then Flipped Blade encountered a galvanized Omnicanon and Legacy's fist - multiple times.</p><p>Easy, but I am quite pleased, as I used cards I rarely use ( namely embolden and omnicanon ).</p>",
