        "id": 169470,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-02T21:29:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint, despite making a couple dumb mistakes (Forgot that I never got around to actually playing the OmniCannon, so I accidentally had Bunker skip his turn to deal with the countdown when I thought I was loading the gun; also, turns out Sacrosanct Martyr is extra useless when all your damage is turned into fire. Oops!)</p><p>Though this was the first time I really took advantage of the whole \"everyone wail on AZ\" strategy, and I didn't realize just how much it let you ramp up the damage.</p>",
