        "id": 169472,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-04T00:22:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Though this was the first time I really took advantage of the whole \"everyone wail on AZ\" strategy, and I didn't realize just how much it let you ramp up the damage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It only really works well if you have several damage boosting effects, or Coolant Blast. &nbsp;But it's a lot of fun, and some of the highest damage scores in the game can be achieved that way.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
