      {
        "id": 169473,
        "name": "JimmyTheCannon",
        "username": "JimmyTheCannon",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/cdc98d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-11T04:52:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Finally got around to doing this one. It was a lot of fun - granted, I knew the self destruct countdown was coming, so I made sure to Impale on AZ’s first turn so I could deal some damage with him while having him hold off the countdown.</p>\n<p>I was tempted to End of Days it but didn’t want to toss more cards into the Baron’s trash.</p>\n<p>I almost played Imbued Fire the turn I got it, but I didn’t trust the Baron - and sure enough, he played Elemental Redistributor on his next turn. Blew that up quickly and then played it.</p>\n<p>Ended up finishing him off with a Fire Blast and Living Conflagration’s power. Never even saw the Backlash Field or Living Force Field.</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
